  "notes": "Historical material/card import retained as provenance; the inherited hkl/d/intensity array is superseded and preserved privately with its full original document. The present peaks are independent kinematic X-ray calculations (0.8-20 A, sum multiplicity*|F|^2, maximum 100), not measured intensities or a recovered source-card selection. Independent calculation from the reported ideal Pa-3 numerical model: Sn 4a and O 8c u=0.346 (Sneed et al. 2019). Use the existing reference cell, not a new pressure-dependent positional refinement. Source reports oxygen disorder; this ordered approximation does not model it. The 48 GPa structural reference does not extend the separate EOS 16.09-28.85 GPa applicability range. The retained u=0.346 is the introduction's reference value, not the paper's refined u=0.3343(5) at 44.5 GPa. Original scientific EOS evidence, observations and applicability limits are unchanged.",
